>Two (possibly) unrelated questions....

>1)  How do I convert an altar?  Do I need a helm of opposite alignment
>in order to do it?

SPOILER

To convert an altar sacrifice a corpse on it when your god is pleased.
If you are not chaotic then don't sacrifice a human corpse.

>2)  I see lots of characters running around the dungeons with
>ridiculously impressive AC's like -17.  Someone on the list mentioned a
>while ago how to get intrinsic AC, but I lost the post.  Would someone
>kindly tell me how to improve this critical stat?

SPOILER

To improve your intrinsic AC #chat to a priest in a temple, any alignment,
and give him 400*your level in gold. If you like you can then kill the priest
and use the gold on the next priest you find.

An AC of -17 is not ridiculous, i can usually get a base AC of -35
without too much trouble. And if i go for intrinsic AC i have got as low 
as -86, all you need is heaps of gold.

